    "text": "By Chief Meteorologist Alex Garcia ,\n8 hours ago SAN ANTONIO - Drive across South Texas right now and you can cross more than county lines. You can cross from one moisture regime into another. Parts of the Hill Country and western South Texas entered August carrying the effects of extraordinary July rainfall. Travel southeast of San Antonio, however, and the picture changes dramatically. Read full article",
